impioprt.ed impmath.ed sta() diem { diem: sta(int n) ed \ kieu tu do va tu che ra ham goi \ } sta(main){ iid: sta(int a) ed \ khai bao bien a \ iid: sta(int i, ipt) == edt: sta(i = 0) ed \ khai bao bien i va tao luon gia tri cho i \ iid: sta(pri) == "hello world" ed \ cau lenh in van ban hoac gia tri cac bien v.v \ iid: sta(ipt) == edt: sta(a) ed \ cau lenh nhap gia tri cho a tu ban phim \ \ day la ghi chu \ iid: sta(for) == cdn,chck: \ vong lap for \ double sta(i ' i < 10 ' i++) { iid: \ lenh \ } dbl ed \ ket thuc kieu double vi co hai dang dac ta thuc thi \ iid: sta(while) == cdn,edt: \ vong lap while \ double sta(int b = 0) == sta(i < 0) { iid: \ lenh \ } dbl ed \ ket thuc kieu double vi co cdn va edt \ iid: sta(struct) == dta: \ kieu cau truc \ sta arr[int a(10) ' str("hello world") ' float a(1.4) ] strt ed \ ket thuc kieu don vi chi co 1 dac ta thuc thi \ iid: sta(void) == unkw: \ kieu ngoai cac du lieu khong duoc doc tru khi duoc goi \ sta nondta{ int c = 2 ' iid: sta(pri) == "void hello" ed ' float d = 32.2 } void ed \ ket thuc kieu void \ iid: sta(bolean) == cdn,tf: \ cau truc logic dung sai kiem tra dieu kien \ sta chcktf (true, false) == sta(a = 0) bln ed \ ket thuc kieu dung sai bolean \ ref* 0 ed: \ day la khi code chay sai logic no se chay ra gia tri diem loi \ }
